cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software package and its mathematical source."
title: "Shiu Bounds Toolkit: Lean Formalization of a Fixed-Quarter Brun–Titchmarsh-Type Bound"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dorsey"
    given-names: "Charlie"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/charliedorsey/shiu-toolkit-palomar-release"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 fixed-quarter specialization of Shiu's multiplicative-function
  estimate, with a derived k=1 theorem and upper-right two-parameter
  monotonicity consequences. Human-directed development used substantive
  AI assistance; proof verification is separate from human peer review.

license: Apache-2.0
references:
